{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16989","headline":"酬李十一尚书西亭暇日书怀见寄十二韵之作 · 武元衡","name":"酬李十一尚书西亭暇日书怀见寄十二韵之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎铉昔云忝，西南分主忧。\n烟尘开僰道，旌节护蛮陬。\n任重功无立，力微恩未酬。\n据鞍慙齿发，责帅惧春秋。\n高德闻郑履，俭居称晏裘。\n三刀君入梦，九折我回輈。\n时景屡迁易，兹言期退休。\n方追故山事，岂谓台堦留。\n遐抱清净理，眷言兰杜幽。\n一缄琼玖赠，万里别离愁。\n巴岭云外没，蜀江天际流。\n怀贤耿遥思，相望凤池头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}